{"active": false, "canEdit": true, "createdAt": "2026-10-21T15:35:06.062Z", "description": "Flujo de soporte por WhatsApp que lee un documento de FAQ, redacta una respuesta y escala a Gmail si es necesario.", "edges": [{"id": "e1", "source": "QTdv9ewMlw_b4h1ZySWuM", "target": "read-faq", "type": "animated"}, {"id": "e2", "source": "read-faq", "target": "generate-response", "type": "animated"}, {"id": "e3", "source": "generate-response", "target": "cond-escalate", "type": "animated"}, {"id": "e4", "source": "generate-response", "target": "cond-reply", "type": "animated"}, {"id": "e5", "source": "cond-escalate", "target": "send-email", "type": "animated"}, {"id": "e6", "source": "cond-reply", "target": "send-whatsapp", "type": "animated"}], "id": "3vfu1w366nhqsqq0mxjxt", "isOwner": true, "name": "Soporte WhatsApp con FAQ y Escalaci\u00f3n Humana", "nodes": [{"data": {"config": {"triggerType": "whatsapp/incoming-message"}, "description": "", "label": "Mensaje Entrante WhatsApp", "status": "idle", "type": "trigger"}, "id": "QTdv9ewMlw_b4h1ZySWuM", "measured": {"height": 192, "width": 192}, "position": {"x": 0, "y": 0}, "selected": false, "type": "trigger"}, {"data": {"config": {"actionType": "composio/run-tool", "arguments": "{\"document_id\": \"doc_faq_soporte_123\"}", "tool": "GOOGLEDOCS_GET_DOCUMENT_PLAINTEXT", "toolkit": "googledocs"}, "label": "Leer Documento FAQ", "type": "action"}, "id": "read-faq", "position": {"x": 350, "y": 200}, "type": "action"}, {"data": {"config": {"actionType": "ai-gateway/generate-text", "aiFormat": "text", "aiModel": "meta/llama-4-scout", "aiPrompt": "Basado en el siguiente documento de preguntas frecuentes:\n{{@read-faq:Leer Documento FAQ.data}}\n\nResponde a este mensaje del cliente:\n{{@QTdv9ewMlw_b4h1ZySWuM:Mensaje Entrante WhatsApp.text}}\n\nSi la consulta no se puede responder con el documento o el cliente pide expl\u00edcitamente un humano, responde \u00fanicamente con la palabra 'ESCALAR'. De lo contrario, redacta la respuesta adecuada para el cliente."}, "label": "Redactar Respuesta", "type": "action"}, "id": "generate-response", "position": {"x": 600, "y": 200}, "type": "action"}, {"data": {"config": {"actionType": "Condition", "condition": "{{@generate-response:Redactar Respuesta.text}}.includes('ESCALAR')"}, "label": "Requiere Escalaci\u00f3n", "type": "action"}, "id": "cond-escalate", "position": {"x": 850, "y": 75}, "type": "action"}, {"data": {"config": {"actionType": "Condition", "condition": "!{{@generate-response:Redactar Respuesta.text}}.includes('ESCALAR')"}, "label": "Responder Directamente", "type": "action"}, "id": "cond-reply", "position": {"x": 850, "y": 325}, "type": "action"}, {"data": {"config": {"actionType": "composio/run-tool", "arguments": "{\"recipient_email\": \"soporte@ejemplo.com\", \"subject\": \"Escalaci\u00f3n de Soporte WhatsApp\", \"body\": \"El cliente {{@QTdv9ewMlw_b4h1ZySWuM:Mensaje Entrante WhatsApp.from}} requiere atenci\u00f3n humana o la consulta no est\u00e1 en el FAQ. Mensaje: {{@QTdv9ewMlw_b4h1ZySWuM:Mensaje Entrante WhatsApp.text}}\"}", "tool": "GMAIL_SEND_EMAIL", "toolkit": "gmail"}, "label": "Enviar Correo a Soporte", "type": "action"}, "id": "send-email", "position": {"x": 1100, "y": 75}, "type": "action"}, {"data": {"config": {"actionType": "whatsapp/send-message", "text": "{{@generate-response:Redactar Respuesta.text}}", "to": "{{@QTdv9ewMlw_b4h1ZySWuM:Mensaje Entrante WhatsApp.from}}"}, "label": "Enviar WhatsApp al Cliente", "type": "action"}, "id": "send-whatsapp", "position": {"x": 1100, "y": 325}, "type": "action"}], "shared": false, "updatedAt": "2026-10-21T15:40:18.864Z", "userId": "KkFp1tAlpswYaS6tiqtN2UYQoaqlzXyz", "visibility": "private"}